  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increasing Access to Market for Fairtrade supply (A12965)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to small-scale producer organisations in Papua New Guinea in agricultural development, particularly those involved in the production of coffee and cocoa, to access global markets through the Fairtrade brand. The activity provides business development and quality improvement support, facilitates access to commercial partners and industry experts and provides training opportunities on cross-cutting issues including gender equality and empowerment.</narrative>
  </description>
